        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 178UST, Solid Brass Universal Strike Plate for Surface Bolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with matching finish mounting screws. Available in 9 different finishes. Can be used with any manufactures surface door bolt that has a 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-178UST-Specifications.gif?v=1704354722\" width=\"386\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Universal Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis strike plate fits <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-6sb\"><b>Deltana 6SB 6\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-8sb\"><b>Deltana 8SB 8\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-12-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-12sb\"><b>Deltana 12SB 12\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-18-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-18sb\"><b>Deltana 18SB 18\" Surface Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-24-inch-surface-bolt-deltana-24sb\"><b>Deltana 24SB 24\" Surface Bolt</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 178UST Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/178UST.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 178UST Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
